m":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T10:23:49-07:00","id":664531,"title":"","content":"Ohh... That is good. That is actually really good. *grins impishly*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7839-caelestio","name":"Caelestio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7839_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T13:29:55-07:00","id":664695,"title":"","content":"They are the &quot;Lord Sages of the Unknown Reaches&quot;. You can find them in the Lords of Summer sourcebook for Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T14:48:17-07:00","id":664839,"title":"","content":"You are awesome! Thank you! <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7839-caelestio","name":"Caelestio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7839_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T03:40:06-07:00","id":666678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caelestio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/664479-changelings-and-other-forms-of-magic#post664479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have read that the Autumn Court for instance delves into other supernatural powers. But cannot seem to find documentation if they can learn other forms of magic? Are Changelings limited to magic of the Fae or can they learn other forms as well?<br /> <br /> Thank you!<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Learning about, and learning to do, are different things. Otherwise Gorillas in the mist would be a move about a woman learning how to become a gorilla. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That being said, there are things they could do, but they would be things anyone can do, not a special power of the autumn court.<br /> <br /> Like making deals with ghosts or spirits, it's not like either group has a &quot;Changelings have cooties&quot; policy. For example, according to Book of the Dead ghosts are valid as social merits, so ghost retainers, ghost allies, ghost contacts, etc.<br /> <br /> Collecting occultism tricks (from Antagonists) or occult matrices (from GMC/Demon), presuming those aren't the same thing of course.<br /> <br /> In a crossover game with hunter, anyone can perform a witch spell as a ritual, changelings are included in anybody.<br /> <br /> Ditto for a mage crossover, if using the &quot;anyone can perform a ritual&quot; rule from the Mage Chroniclers Guide.<br /> <br /> And there's nothing inherent in the sorcery rules from Mirrors that bans changeling, if using that option.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}